# Copilot's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-copilot-setting-token = 订阅 Copilot 的账号的 GitHub 令牌，例如从 https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens 创建的无需额外权限的细粒度个人访问令牌，或 `gh auth token` 的输出。若主机上的 Copilot 编辑器插件已登录，则无需填写。
usage-copilot-setting-enterprise-host = 适用于启用数据驻留的 GitHub Enterprise Cloud：填写主机名，例如 octocorp.ghe.com。随后将从 api.<host> 读取用量。

## The report: premium request and chat quotas, and credits used.

usage-copilot-premium = 高级
usage-copilot-chat = 聊天
usage-copilot-credits = 积分
usage-copilot-credits-used = 已用积分
usage-copilot-quota = 配额
usage-copilot-unlimited = 无限制
